 "_about": "Thermal tripping band of Schneider Electric Acti9 MCBs, IEC/EN 60898-1 (reference temperature 30 C), digitised from the vector curves on page 206 of the Acti9 catalogue (Version 2.0 - May 2017, 'Tripping curves'). Each curve is a list of [I/In, t(s)] points on log-log axes: `max` is the slowest trip time (upper boundary), `min` the fastest (lower boundary). Calibrated on the chart's own grid (decade lines); verified against the IEC 60898-1 gates (no trip at 1.13 In within 1 h, trip at 1.45 In within 1 h, 1-60 s (1-120 s above 32 A) at 2.55 In). Produced by digitize_acti9.py.",
